    "nic_faq_kxwhNh": {
      "type": "nic-faq",
      "blocks": {
        "question_XijPwD": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What is special about these leggings?",
            "answer": "<p>They look like regular tights, but they are super warm inside.</p><p>They have two layers: outside they look like your real skin, inside they have soft fleece that keeps you warm.</p><p>The best part? They have only one seam in the back (not two like the old tights). This means no diaper effect on the butt.</p><p>The waistband is firm and flattens your tummy, while your butt stays round and lifted.</p><p>They're very hard to tear, unlike regular tights that rip right away.</p>",
            "open": false
          }
        },
        "question_RW49JC": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What size should I take?",
            "answer": "<p>Check your weight:</p><p><strong>XS/S</strong>: 40 to 63 kg<br/><strong>M/L</strong>: 59 to 84 kg<br/><strong>L/XL</strong>: 79 to 100 kg<br/><strong>2XL/3XL</strong>: 98 to 136 kg</p><p>If you are between two sizes, take the larger one. You will be more comfortable.</p><p>Example: do you weigh 86 kg and are 168 cm tall? Take M/L and it will fit perfectly.</p>",
            "open": false
          }
        },
        "question_NWDUHK": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How do I determine my shade?",
            "answer": "<p>We have 4 colors that look like real skin:</p><p><strong>Vanilla/Light</strong>: very fair skin<br/><strong>Tan</strong>: tanned skin<br/><strong>Bronze</strong>: darker skin<br/><strong>Espresso</strong>: very dark skin</p><p><strong>IMPORTANT</strong>: Choose the color of YOUR real skin. Not the color you wish you had!</p><p>Many girls make a mistake. They think \"Light is too light for me\" and choose Tan. Then they have to change it because Tan is really TAN.</p><p>If you are unsure between two colors, always choose the lighter one.</p><p>Look at the photos on our page where all the legs are side by side. It helps you understand.</p>",
            "open": false
          }
        },
        "question_DKwgxf": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Will they tear easily?",
            "answer": "<p>These leggings are designed for everyday wear. Follow the care instructions to help preserve the fabric and avoid damage from sharp objects or rough surfaces.</p><p>Our lifetime warranty covers structural manufacturing defects during the product’s useful life under normal use and proper care. It does not cover normal wear, accidental damage or improper washing.</p><p>If you notice a possible manufacturing defect, contact <a href=\"mailto:info@leishape.com\">info@leishape.com</a> with your order number and photos. If the defect is covered, LeiShape will replace the product free of charge and cover the necessary shipping costs.</p><p>See our <a href=\"https://leishape.com/policies/refund-policy\" title=\"Refund Policy\">Returns & Refunds</a> Policy for full warranty conditions. Your statutory consumer rights remain unaffected.</p>",
            "open": false
          }
        },
        "question_AYRg6y": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Are they really warm?",
            "answer": "<p><strong>YES!</strong> Super warm.</p><p>You can wear them down to -10°C. Even when it's freezing cold.</p><p>The fleece inside keeps you warm as if you were wearing pants. But from the outside, it looks like you have bare legs.</p><p>You can finally wear skirts and short dresses even in winter!</p><p>The fleece goes down to the ankle. The feet are normal (so you don't sweat inside the boots).</p>",
            "open": false
          }
        },
        "question_z4AnwM": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Will it show that they're not my real legs?",
            "answer": "<p><strong>NO!</strong> They really look like your skin.</p><p>They hide everything:</p><p>• Cellulite<br/>• Marks<br/>• Veins<br/>• Imperfections</p><p>A girl on TikTok said: \"You can't convince me that these aren't my real legs!\"</p><p>You can bend, sit, move. They always remain opaque. No one will see anything embarrassing.</p><p>Your legs will look perfect and smooth.</p>",
            "open": false
          }
        },
        "question_CHbjGE": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How are they washed?",
            "answer": "<p>• Wash by hand or in the washing machine at 30 degrees<br/>• Use the delicate program<br/>• Do not use bleach<br/>• Do not iron them<br/>• Avoid the dryer (or use low temperature)</p><p>They remain like new even after many washes.</p><p><strong>Tip:</strong> If you have 2-3 pairs, you can alternate them. This way, you wash them less often and they last longer.</p>",
            "open": false
          }
        },
        "question_inHKmn": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "When will my order arrive?",
            "answer": "<p><strong>SHIPPING TIMES:</strong></p><p>Arrives in 5-7 days</p><p><strong>WHAT YOU RECEIVE:</strong></p><p>📦 Tracking number to follow the package<br/>📞 Assistance always available if you have questions</p><p><strong>WARNING:</strong> We are in winter season. The most requested sizes sell out quickly!</p>",
            "open": false
          }
        },
        "question_zJUnEV": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "When will my order arrive?",
            "answer": "<p>Delivery takes [5-7] days. Shipping is tracked, and you receive the tracking link by email as soon as your order leaves the warehouse.</p>",
            "open": false
          }
        },
        "question_JThYQU": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What if I don't like it?",
            "answer": "<p>You can return it within [30] days. Email <strong>info@nicshape.com</strong> and we will guide you through the return and refund.</p>",
            "open": false
          }
        }
      },
